<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan Industrial Credit rises 11 pct.</title>
<headline>Pakistan Industrial Credit rises 11 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan Industrial Credit and Investment Corp (PICIC) 10-rupee stock rose one rupee, or 11.30 percent, to 9.85 onThursday on the Karachi Stock Exchange, dealers said.</p>
<p>PICIC stock rose on fresh buying on reports of higher recovery of loans during the current financial year ending in June, one dealer said. Turnover was 1,000 shares.</p>
<p>PICIC is one of the oldest lending institution in Pakistan.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
